# ProcMix environment overrides (copy to `.env` for local dev; `.env` is gitignored).
# The backend loads `.env` from the `app/` directory at startup (via dotenvy).

# Plugin catalog source — where installable plugins are read from.
#   - Unset (default):
#       * debug build  → the local mock catalog at `app/.mocks/plugins`
#       * release build → the bundled/remote catalog (GitHub; not wired yet)
#   - A filesystem path → use that local versioned catalog
#       (layout: <path>/<name>/v<MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH>/plugin.json)
#   - An http(s) URL → a remote catalog (reserved for the future GitHub source;
#       currently rejected with a clear error)
#
# Example (point at the bundled mock catalog explicitly):
# PROCMIX_PLUGIN_CATALOG=./.mocks/plugins
